          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\" />\\n  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Reach {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}} at {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — warm, safety-forward aromatherapy membership and bespoke support in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.\\\" />\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --bg-1: #f7f3ee; /* soft parchment */\\n      --accent-1: #a65a3b; /* terracotta */\\n      --accent-2: #7a9a6e; /* sage */\\n      --muted: #6b6b6b;\\n      --card: #fffaf6;\\n      --radius: 14px;\\n      --maxw: 1100px;\\n      --shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(20,20,20,0.08);\\n      font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial;\\n    }\\n    html,body{height:100%;}\\n    body{\\n      margin:0;\\n      background: radial-gradient(1200px 600px at 10% 10%, rgba(166,90,59,0.06), transparent 6%),\\n                  radial-gradient(800px 400px at 90% 90%, rgba(122,154,110,0.05), transparent 6%),\\n                  var(--bg-1);\\n      color:#2e2a26;\\n      -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;\\n      -moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;\\n      line-height:1.45;\\n    }\\n    .wrap{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:40px auto;padding:32px;}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;margin-bottom:28px;}\\n    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;text-decoration:none;color:inherit}\\n    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent-2),var(--accent-1));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-weight:700;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}\\n    nav a{margin-left:18px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}\\n    nav a.active{color:var(--accent-1)}\\n\\n    /* pattern SVG sits behind content */\\n    .bg-svg{position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;opacity:0.28;filter:blur(0.6px);}\\n\\n    main{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px;align-items:start}\\n\\n    /* hero */\\n    .hero{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.6), rgba(255,255,255,0.32));padding:28px;border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow)}\\n    .hero h1{margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:28px;color:var(--accent-1)}\\n    .hero p.lead{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    /* contact card */\\n    .card{background:var(--card);padding:20px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(28,24,20,0.06)}\\n    form .row{display:flex;gap:12px}\\n    label{display:block;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px}\\n    input[type=text],input[type=email],textarea,select{width:100%;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(42,38,34,0.06);background:#fff;font-size:15px}\\n    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}\\n    .btn{display:inline-block;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent-1),#d67a54);color:#fff;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;border:none;cursor:pointer}\\n    .subtle{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    /* myth vs truth */\\n    .two-col{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:20px}\\n    .panel{background:#fff;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(40,36,32,0.03)}\\n    .panel h3{margin:0 0 6px 0;color:var(--accent-2);font-size:15px}\\n    .truth{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\\n\\n    /* pillars */\\n    .pillars{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:22px}\\n    .pillar{flex:1;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.9),#fff);padding:14px;border-radius:10px}\\n    .pillar h4{margin:0 0 6px 0;color:var(--accent-1)}\\n\\n    /* case notes */\\n    .case-list{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .case{padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:#fff;font-size:14px;border-left:4px solid rgba(122,154,110,0.14)}\\n\\n    /* faq */\\n    .faq{margin-top:18px}\\n    .qa{margin-bottom:12px}\\n    .q{font-weight:700;color:var(--accent-2);font-size:14px}\\n    .a{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\\n\\n    footer{margin-top:28px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px dashed rgba(30,26,22,0.04);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n    .meta{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    @media (max-width:980px){main{grid-template-columns:1fr;}\\n      .wrap{padding:18px;margin:18px}\\n      nav a{display:none}\\n    }\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body class=\\\"earthy_warm\\\">\\n  <!-- decorative SVG pattern: unique and hand-drawn feel -->\\n  <svg class=\\\"bg-svg\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 1200 800\\\" preserveAspectRatio=\\\"xMidYMid slice\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n    <defs>\\n      <pattern id=\\\"leafPattern\\\" x=\\\"0\\\" y=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"120\\\" height=\\\"120\\\" patternUnits=\\\"userSpaceOnUse\\\">\\n        <rect width=\\\"120\\\" height=\\\"120\\\" fill=\\\"transparent\\\"></rect>\\n        <g transform=\\\"translate(20,20)\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke-opacity=\\\"0.22\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\">\\n          <path d=\\\"M10 60 C 18 30, 52 30, 60 60\\\" stroke=\\\"#7a9a6e\\\" stroke-width=\\\"3\\\" />\\n          <path d=\\\"M30 80 C 36 54, 84 54, 90 80\\\" stroke=\\\"#a65a3b\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" />\\n          <circle cx=\\\"70\\\" cy=\\\"28\\\" r=\\\"5\\\" fill=\\\"#d9bba8\\\" opacity=\\\"0.6\\\" />\\n        </g>\\n      </pattern>\\n    </defs>\\n    <rect width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" fill=\\\"url(#leafPattern)\\\" />\\n  </svg>\\n\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <a class=\\\"brand\\\" href=\\\"index.html\\\" aria-label=\\\"home\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"logo\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </a>\\n      <nav aria-label=\\\"main navigation\\\">\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Offerings</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"blends.html\\\">Aroma Library</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"shop.html\\\">Store</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Memberships</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">Our Story</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Sessions</a>\\n        <a class=\\\"active\\\" href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Connect</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <main>\\n      <section>\\n        <div class=\\\"hero card\\\">\\n          <h1>Let’s craft your calming rituals together</h1>\\n          <p class=\\\"lead\\\">Reach out to {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}} to ask about membership options, bespoke blends, or safety-first guidance for using essential oils with care. We focus on sensory wellbeing, never medical diagnosis.</p>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:12px;align-items:center\\\">\\n            <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n            <div class=\\\"subtle\\\">Prefer a quick note? Call <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong> or email <strong>{{EMAIL}}</strong></div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"two-col\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"panel\\\">\\n              <h3>Myth: Essential oils cure illness</h3>\\n              <p class=\\\"truth\\\">Aromatherapy supports relaxation and ritual. It is not a replacement for professional medical care. Always consult licensed providers for health concerns.</p>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"panel\\\">\\n              <h3>Truth: Safety and dilution matter</h3>\\n              <p class=\\\"truth\\\">We prioritize safe practices: clear dilution guidance, patch testing, and tailored recommendations—especially around children, pregnancy, and pets.</p>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"pillars\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"pillar\\\">\\n              <h4>Sensory Craft</h4>\\n              <div class=\\\"subtle\\\">Blends composed from top/middle/base notes for layered, gentle aroma profiles.</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"pillar\\\">\\n              <h4>Safety First</h4>\\n              <div class=\\\"subtle\\\">Clear dilution, patch tests, and non-medical guidance embedded in every recommendation.</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"pillar\\\">\\n              <h4>Community &amp; Membership</h4>\\n              <div class=\\\"subtle\\\">Monthly care prompts, seasonal blends, and a supportive community for ritual-making.</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:14px\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n            <h3 style=\\\"margin-top:0;color:var(--accent-1)\\\">Contact form</h3>\\n            <form action=\\\"#\\\" method=\\\"post\\\" onsubmit=\\\"event.preventDefault(); alert('Thank you — we will be in touch.');\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"row\\\">\\n                <div style=\\\"flex:1\\\">\\n                  <label for=\\\"name\\\">Your name</label>\\n                  <input id=\\\"name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"Jane Doe\\\" required />\\n                </div>\\n                <div style=\\\"width:170px\\\">\\n                  <label for=\\\"phone\\\">Phone</label>\\n                  <input id=\\\"phone\\\" name=\\\"phone\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"{{PHONE}}\\\" />\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n              <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">\\n                <label for=\\\"email\\\">Email</label>\\n                <input id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"{{EMAIL}}\\\" required />\\n              </div>\\n              <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">\\n                <label for=\\\"topic\\\">How can we help?</label>\\n                <select id=\\\"topic\\\" name=\\\"topic\\\">\\n                  <option>Membership inquiry</option>\\n                  <option>Custom blend request</option>\\n                  <option>Safety guidance / patch test</option>\\n                  <option>Wholesale / events</option>\\n                  <option>Other</option>\\n                </select>\\n              </div>\\n              <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">\\n                <label for=\\\"message\\\">Message</label>\\n                <textarea id=\\\"message\\\" name=\\\"message\\\" placeholder=\\\"Tell us briefly about your goals, sensitivities, or timeline.\\\"></textarea>\\n              </div>\\n              <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px\\\">\\n                <input id=\\\"consent\\\" type=\\\"checkbox\\\" required />\\n                <label for=\\\"consent\\\" class=\\\"subtle\\\">I consent to {{BUSINESS_NAME}} holding my contact details to respond. I understand aromatherapy is supportive and not medical care.</label>\\n              </div>\\n              <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n                <button class=\\\"btn\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Send note</button>\\n                <span style=\\\"margin-left:12px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px\\\">Or schedule a session: <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book a session</a></span>\\n              </div>\\n            </form>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <aside>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin-top:0;color:var(--accent-2)\\\">Quick notes</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"subtle\\\">Hours: gentle scheduling by appointment. Membership benefits include monthly blends, safety check-ins, and community rituals.</p>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"meta\\\"><strong>Phone</strong><br/><a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"meta\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\"><strong>Email</strong><br/><a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"meta\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\"><strong>Location</strong><br/>{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px 0;color:var(--accent-1)\\\">Care notes</h4>\\n          <div class=\\\"case-list\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"case\\\">\\n              <strong>Ritual reset</strong>\\n              <div class=\\\"subtle\\\">Layered citrus-top with lavender heart for evening ease; low dilution for sensitive skin.</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"case\\\">\\n              <strong>Midsummer blend</strong>\\n              <div class=\\\"subtle\\\">Herbal brightness with grounding base notes—created for a membership kit.</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"case\\\">\\n              <strong>Morning clarity</strong>\\n              <div class=\\\"subtle\\\">Uplifting aroma profile with mild stimulation; advised no direct skin application without dilution.</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"case\\\">\\n              <strong>Sleep companion</strong>\\n              <div class=\\\"subtle\\\">A soft floral-woody blend in a diffuser-friendly dilution.</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px 0;color:var(--accent-2)\\\">FAQ highlights</h4>\\n          <div class=\\\"faq\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"qa\\\"><div class=\\\"q\\\">How should I dilute oils?</div><div class=\\\"a\\\">We recommend safe dilution ranges in each recipe—typically 1–3% for adults for topical use unless otherwise advised. Always do a patch test first.</div></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"qa\\\"><div class=\\\"q\\\">What is a patch test?</div><div class=\\\"a\\\">Apply a diluted drop on inner forearm and wait 24 hours to watch for irritation. If redness or discomfort occurs, discontinue use.</div></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"qa\\\"><div class=\\\"q\\\">Are oils safe for pets?</div><div class=\\\"a\\\">Some essential oils are not pet-safe. We always provide pet-specific guidance; never diffuse or apply without consultation if pets are present.</div></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"qa\\\"><div class=\\\"q\\\">Pregnancy and nursing?</div><div class=\\\"a\\\">Certain oils are not recommended during pregnancy or breastfeeding. Please consult your care provider and mention pregnancy when contacting us.</div></div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n      </aside>\\n    </main>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div class=\\\"meta\\\">&copy; <span id=\\\"year\\\">2026</span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — {{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"meta\\\">Need immediate assistance? <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a> • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <script>\\n    // small progressive enhancement: current year\\n    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();\\n  </script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"# Aromatherapy Site — Contact Page (Chunk 4)\\n\\nThis bundle contains two files for chunk 4 of the aromatherapy website build.\\n\\nFiles included:\\n\\n- `contact.html` — full contact/connect page with inline SVG background pattern, responsive layout, safety-forward copy, and an accessible contact form.\\n- `README.md` — this file with instructions and the recommended SVG asset content.\\n\\nDesign notes\\n\\n- Layout family: earthy_warm. Colors are warm terracotta and sage with soft parchment backgrounds.\\n- Voice: warm_storyteller — copy invites ritual-making while emphasizing safety and non-medical framing.\\n- Offer model: membership is referenced in the copy and CTAs.\\n- Navigation labels are intentionally varied for uniqueness (e.g., \\\"Offerings\\\", \\\"Aroma Library\\\", \\\"Memberships\\\", \\\"Sessions\\\", \\\"Connect\\\").\\n- No external images, fonts, or CDNs are used. Visual richness is achieved via CSS gradients, an inline SVG pattern, and careful spacing.\\n\\nPlaceholders (keep these in templates and replace at build-time):\\n\\n- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}\\n- {{TAGLINE}}\\n- {{PHONE}}\\n- {{EMAIL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\n- {{CITY}}\\n- {{STATE}}\\n- {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}\\n- {{FAVORITE_BLEND}}\\n\\nAccessibility & safety reminders\\n\\n- Language intentionally avoids medical claims. Phrases like \\\"supports\\\" and \\\"ritual\\\" are used instead of treatment claims.\\n- FAQ and callouts include information about dilution, patch testing, pregnancy, and pets.\\n- The contact form includes explicit consent text and a non-medical disclaimer.\\n\\nSVG asset (recommended)\\n\\nA unique background SVG pattern is expected at `assets/img/pattern.svg` for use across pages. If you prefer a separate file instead of the inline SVG already included in `contact.html`, create `assets/img/pattern.svg` with the following content:\\n\\n<?xml version=\\\"1.0\\\" encoding=\\\"UTF-8\\\"?>\\n<svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 120 120\\\">\\n  <defs>\\n    <pattern id=\\\"leafPatternFile\\\" x=\\\"0\\\" y=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"120\\\" height=\\\"120\\\" patternUnits=\\\"userSpaceOnUse\\\">\\n      <rect width=\\\"120\\\" height=\\\"120\\\" fill=\\\"transparent\\\"></rect>\\n      <g transform=\\\"translate(20,20)\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke-opacity=\\\"0.22\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\">\\n        <path d=\\\"M10 60 C 18 30, 52 30, 60 60\\\" stroke=\\\"#7a9a6e\\\" stroke-width=\\\"3\\\" />\\n        <path d=\\\"M30 80 C 36 54, 84 54, 90 80\\\" stroke=\\\"#a65a3b\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" />\\n        <circle cx=\\\"70\\\" cy=\\\"28\\\" r=\\\"5\\\" fill=\\\"#d9bba8\\\" opacity=\\\"0.6\\\" />\\n      </g>\\n    </pattern>\\n  </defs>\\n  <rect width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" fill=\\\"url(#leafPatternFile)\\\" />\\n</svg>\\n\\nImplementation notes\\n\\n- The `contact.html` page is a standalone static page. Replace the placeholders during your templating/build step.\\n- Navigation links point to the expected pages: index.html, services.html, blends.html, shop.html, pricing.html, about.html, book.html, contact.html.\\n- The contact form currently prevents default submission and shows a simple alert for demo. Replace this behavior with your backend or form handling service.\\n- Keep copy safety-first: when adding blend descriptions or testimonial-like case notes, avoid any language that suggests cure or medical efficacy.\\n\\nFurther chunks will include the other site pages and the finalized `assets/img/pattern.svg` file if you prefer it externalized. If you want the pattern file created here instead of later, let me know and I will include it in the next update.\"}\nBUNDLE_END"
